OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure warning after crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA road has been closed in Derby
OL,6,Ffollowing a crash, police said.
OL,8,FThe A61 Sir Frank Whittle Way is shut
OL,9,Fbetween the Hampshire Road and the
OL,10,FWheatcroft Way roundabouts.
OL,12,FDerbyshire Police announced the closure
OL,13,Fat 04:25 GMT on Friday and said it
OL,14,Fwould remain for "some time".
OL,16,FDrivers were urged to avoid the area
OL,17,Fand find alternative routes.
